@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — operation effect versus observation
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Intended operation / attempt identity\nCurrent exact subject / revision / authority" as Intent
rectangle "Actual effect evidence\nConfirmed / failed / partial / pending / unknown" as Evidence
rectangle "Permitted next action\nObserve / reconcile same context; separately eligible retry" as Next
Intent --> Evidence : request or missing reply is not the effect
Evidence --> Next : no blind resend / restart / deploy
note bottom of Evidence
Failure or timeout does not universally prove old state / rollback.
Cancel request is not confirmed stop; completion may win race.
Evidence access itself needs a bounded grant and secret protection.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
